{
  "_comment": "Track REG_arch_v5: Track T (P3 + tail-focal BCE) + REG_arch FiLM γ+β + sequence-level direction BCE at 6 anchors (t=100/200/300/400/500/last). use_seq_direction_head=True exposes seq_dir_logits (B, T); trainer applies BCE against sign(y_600) at anchors with weight lambda_seq_direction=0.10. Hypothesis: deep supervision at multiple temporal positions strengthens direction signal in intermediate Conformer representations → improves pooled DA (target 0.58 vs current 0.5297).",
